    {
      "id": "9B-MUva-Ng5QB88x11lpy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1095,
      "y": -120.5,
      "width": 492,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "strokeSharpness": "round",
      "seed": 1788768099,
      "version": 95,
      "versionNonce": 1330802371,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "xQYRA3DQ_q6jS_d7rdHVA",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1653125514646,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The OVN Northbound  Database  receives  the  intermediate\nrepresentation  of  logical  network configuration passed\ndown by the OVN/CMS Plugin. The database schema is  meant\nto  be  ``impedance matched’’ with the concepts used in a\nCMS, so that it  directly  supports  notions  of  logical\nswitches,  routers,  ACLs,  and  so on. See ovn-nb(5) for\ndetails.\n\nThe OVN Northbound Database has  only  two  clients:  the\nOVN/CMS Plugin above it and ovn-northd below it",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 204,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The OVN Northbound  Database  receives  the  intermediate\nrepresentation  of  logical  network configuration passed\ndown by the OVN/CMS Plugin. The database schema is  meant\nto  be  ``impedance matched’’ with the concepts used in a\nCMS, so that it  directly  supports  notions  of  logical\nswitches,  routers,  ACLs,  and  so on. See ovn-nb(5) for\ndetails.\n\nThe OVN Northbound Database has  only  two  clients:  the\nOVN/CMS Plugin above it and ovn-northd below it"
    },
    {
      "id": "946bn3VRHuUHkhZOPS4vT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 383.62848808729314,
      "y": 85.59177720520938,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 126,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "strokeSharpness": "round",
      "seed": 1627162339,
      "version": 464,
      "versionNonce": 1981259853,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1653125570451,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ovn-northd(8)  connects  to  the  OVN Northbound Database\nabove it and the OVN Southbound  Database  below  it.  It\ntranslates  the logical network configuration in terms of\nconventional network concepts, taken from the OVN  North‐\nbound  Database,  into  logical datapath flows in the OVN\nSouthbound Database below it.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 120,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ovn-northd(8)  connects  to  the  OVN Northbound Database\nabove it and the OVN Southbound  Database  below  it.  It\ntranslates  the logical network configuration in terms of\nconventional network concepts, taken from the OVN  North‐\nbound  Database,  into  logical datapath flows in the OVN\nSouthbound Database below it."
    },
    {
      "id": "02Mw3BDRjceC3eykKOvtg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1095,
      "y": 203,
      "width": 533,
      "height": 252,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "strokeSharpness": "round",
      "seed": 169690797,
      "version": 83,
      "versionNonce": 557686371,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1653125514646,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The OVN Southbound Database is the center of the  system.\nIts  clients  are  ovn-northd(8)  above  it  and ovn-controller(8) \non every transport node below it.\n\nThe OVN Southbound Database contains three kinds of data:\nPhysical  Network  (PN)  tables that specify how to reach\nhypervisor and other nodes, Logical Network  (LN)  tables\nthat  describe  the logical network in terms of ``logical\ndatapath flows,’’ and Binding tables  that  link  logical\nnetwork  components’  locations  to the physical network.\nThe hypervisors populate the PN and Port_Binding  tables,\nwhereas ovn-northd(8) populates the LN tables.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 246,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The OVN Southbound Database is the center of the  system.\nIts  clients  are  ovn-northd(8)  above  it  and ovn-controller(8) \non every transport node below it.\n\nThe OVN Southbound Database contains three kinds of data:\nPhysical  Network  (PN)  tables that specify how to reach\nhypervisor and other nodes, Logical Network  (LN)  tables\nthat  describe  the logical network in terms of ``logical\ndatapath flows,’’ and Binding tables  that  link  logical\nnetwork  components’  locations  to the physical network.\nThe hypervisors populate the PN and Port_Binding  tables,\nwhereas ovn-northd(8) populates the LN tables."
    },
