    },
    {
      "id": "dZvCZottMDR1KSrXzIN-z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.97358144878672,
      "y": 331.08737411334073,
      "width": 536,
      "height": 168,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "#ced4da",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "strokeSharpness": "round",
      "seed": 2022178435,
      "version": 347,
      "versionNonce": 1611236579,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1653125556413,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ovn-controller(8) is OVN’s agent on each  hypervisor  and\nsoftware  gateway.  Northbound,  it  connects  to the OVN\nSouthbound Database to learn about OVN configuration  and\nstatus  and to populate the PN table and the Chassis column \nin Binding table with the hypervisor’s status. Southbound, it \nconnects to ovs-vswitchd(8) as an OpenFlow controller, for \ncontrol over network  traffic,  and  to  the local  ovsdb-server(1) \nto allow it to monitor and control Open vSwitch configuration.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 162,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ovn-controller(8) is OVN’s agent on each  hypervisor  and\nsoftware  gateway.  Northbound,  it  connects  to the OVN\nSouthbound Database to learn about OVN configuration  and\nstatus  and to populate the PN table and the Chassis column \nin Binding table with the hypervisor’s status. Southbound, it \nconnects to ovs-vswitchd(8) as an OpenFlow controller, for \ncontrol over network  traffic,  and  to  the local  ovsdb-server(1) \nto allow it to monitor and control Open vSwitch configuration."
    },
